To move the title to a different position in your **Government Dashboard**, let's assume you want to move it either to the **left** of the screen or place it at the **top left corner**. I’ll show you how to modify the **CSS** to achieve this, based on a couple of layout variations.

### 1. **Move the Title to the Left of the Page (Sidebar-style)**

If you want the title to appear in the **sidebar** or to the left of the page, here's how you can adjust the layout:

#### **HTML Update**:
We’ll move the title to the sidebar by placing it inside a new `div` inside the `.sidebar`.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Government Dashboard</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <div class="logo">Pandemic Resilience System</div>
</header>

<div class="sidebar">
    <div class="title">Pandemic Resilience</div> <!-- Moved title here -->
    <a href="#">Dashboard</a>
    <a href="#">Vaccination Tracking</a>
    <a href="#">Supply Chain Management</a>
    <a href="#">Reports</a>
</div>

<div class="main-content">
    <div class="box">
        <h2>Supply Chain Overview</h2>
        <!-- Add content here -->
    </div>
    <div class="stats">
        <!-- Add stat sections here -->
    </div>
    <div class="graph">
        <p>Graph Placeholder</p>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
```

#### **CSS Update**:

```css
/* Sidebar styling */
.sidebar {
  width: 250px;
  background-color: #2f2f2f;
  position: fixed;
  height: 100%;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  padding-top: 20px;
}

.sidebar .title {
  color: white;
  font-size: 2rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-align: left;
  padding: 20px;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  margin-bottom: 30px; /* Add spacing below the title */
}

.sidebar a {
  color: white;
  padding: 15px;
  text-decoration: none;
  display: block;
  text-align: left; /* Align text to the left */
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.sidebar a:hover {
  background-color: #575757;
}
```

- **`header` and `.sidebar`**: Now, the title "Pandemic Resilience" is moved into the sidebar with larger text and bold font to make it prominent.
- **Spacing and styling**: Adjusted the margin and padding to ensure the title is visually separated from other sidebar items.

